1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,871
Every child learns
the gods made the

2
00:00:01,891 --> 00:00:02,584
world.

3
00:00:02,604 --> 00:00:03,865
What if they're
lying?

4
00:00:03,885 --> 00:00:05,065
Meet the First Lamp.

5
00:00:05,085 --> 00:00:06,491
It fell from the sky.

6
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:08,512
The lazy version:
the myth is simply

7
00:00:08,532 --> 00:00:09,250
true.

8
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,298
Press run.

9
00:00:10,318 --> 00:00:11,535
Five hundred years.

10
00:00:11,555 --> 00:00:12,435
Nobody digs.

11
00:00:12,455 --> 00:00:13,818
Nothing to find.

12
00:00:13,838 --> 00:00:16,121
A myth that's just
true is a textbook.

13
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:17,921
Wrong myths build
better worlds.

14
00:00:17,941 --> 00:00:19,071
Four rules.

15
00:00:19,091 --> 00:00:20,657
The fifth is the
twist.

16
00:00:20,677 --> 00:00:21,920
One:
bury proof.

17
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,651
Bones older than the
gods.

18
00:00:23,671 --> 00:00:24,951
Two:
give it a job.

19
00:00:24,971 --> 00:00:26,766
The Queen's crown
rests on it.

20
00:00:26,786 --> 00:00:28,221
Three:
let someone dig.

21
00:00:28,241 --> 00:00:30,393
The cliffs count ten
thousand years.

22
00:00:30,413 --> 00:00:31,905
Four:
let someone hide it.

23
00:00:31,925 --> 00:00:33,768
Keepers paint over
the holes.

24
00:00:33,788 --> 00:00:34,606
Run it again.

25
00:00:34,626 --> 00:00:35,693
Five hundred years.

26
00:00:35,713 --> 00:00:37,087
They're still
arguing.

27
00:00:37,107 --> 00:00:37,887
Rule five?

28
00:00:37,907 --> 00:00:39,387
The myth isn't lying
at all.

29
00:00:39,407 --> 00:00:40,709
It's remembering.

30
00:00:40,729 --> 00:00:42,131
A star really fell
here.

31
00:00:42,151 --> 00:00:43,425
It made the lake.

32
00:00:43,445 --> 00:00:45,456
So hide the truth
inside the myth.

33
00:00:45,476 --> 00:00:46,718
Myths aren't lies.

34
00:00:46,738 --> 00:00:47,943
Every myth is a
memory,

35
00:00:47,963 --> 00:00:49,105
told wrong.

36
00:00:49,125 --> 00:00:50,316
Would you tell them
the truth,

37
00:00:50,336 --> 00:00:51,491
or keep the myth?

38
00:00:51,511 --> 00:00:53,185
Part 34 of 50.

39
00:00:53,205 --> 00:00:56,097
Follow for part 35:
the ruins are older

40
00:00:56,117 --> 00:00:57,197
than us.
